config ADC_PHY62X2
	bool "PHY62x2 ADC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_PHYPLUS_PHY62X2_ADC_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the ADC of the PHY62x2: six single-ended and four differential inputs of 12 bits,
	  the inputs below 1 V. The driver polls for the end of a conversion.
